```Detection 2: Password spraying | MITRE T1110.003 | Data: index=test sourcetype=linux_secure```
```Status: NOT YET RUN - validate before claiming it works```
index=test sourcetype=linux_secure "Failed password"
| rex field=_raw "Failed password for (invalid user )?(?<ssh_user>\S+) from (?<src_ip>\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)"
| bin _time span=10m
| stats dc(ssh_user) as unique_users, count by _time, src_ip
| where unique_users > 5 AND (count/unique_users) < 3
